/*--------------------------------------------

 Gullstrand 1 Eye Accommodated

 NOTE: all radii / thicknesses / heights are in metres, matching the
 convention used everywhere else in the app. As with the relaxed file,
 these were previously in millimetres.

 The lens is Gullstrand's number 1 exact eye ACCOMMODATED (about 10.9 D): the lens surfaces are steeper and the
 lens thicker, and its front moves forward (aqueous 2.7 mm instead of 3.1 mm) - ant. lens R 5.333, ant. core R 2.655,
 post. core R -2.655, post. lens R -5.333 mm; cortex 0.6725, core 2.655, cortex 0.6725 mm. The cornea, the media, the
 back of the lens and the retina are the same as the relaxed eye.

----------------------------------------------*/
